## Phase Breakdown

We will work in these 13 phases, creating a verification artifact at the end of each.

### Phase 1: Backend Scaffolding
- Set up directory layouts exactly as specified.
- Write [requirements.txt](file:///b:/sih/backend/requirements.txt).
- Write [database.py](file:///b:/sih/backend/app/database.py) for engine/session connection setup.
- Write [models.py](file:///b:/sih/backend/app/models.py).
- Setup Alembic and write initial seed data utility [seed_data.py](file:///b:/sih/backend/app/utils/seed_data.py) with realistic, pre-hashed teacher/student credentials.

### Phase 2: Auth + RBAC
- Write password hashing and JWT encoding/decoding utilities in [security.py](file:///b:/sih/backend/app/utils/security.py).
- Create login/register endpoints in [auth.py](file:///b:/sih/backend/app/api/routes/auth.py).
- Implement role restriction dependency `require_role(*roles)` guarding endpoints based on embedded JWT credentials.

### Phase 3: Admin Domain APIs
- Implement CRUD endpoints in `rooms.py`, `faculty.py`, `classes.py`, `students.py`, and `users.py` with pagination controls.

### Phase 4: Timetable API & Conflict Engine
- Implement conflict logic in `conflict_engine.py`.
- Wire it into `timetable.py` route handlers (`POST` / `PUT`) to reject clashing slots.
- Write pytest test suite for clashing conditions.

### Phase 5: Attendance + Assignments + Grades APIs
- Write endpoints for marking/viewing attendance, creating assignments, posting submissions, and uploading student grades.

### Phase 6: Analytics & Aggregate Endboards
- Write `risk_engine.py`, `health_engine.py`, and `trend_engine.py`.
- Integrate engines into aggregate dashboard route handlers (`GET /api/dashboard/admin`, `GET /api/dashboard/teacher/{id}`, and `GET /api/dashboard/student/{id}`).

### Phase 7: Announcements API
- Implement announcements routing supporting general, classroom-specific, and priority filters.

### Phase 8: Frontend Scaffolding
- Establish React layout structure via Vite.
- Set up React Context auth wrapper and Axios API client.
- Integrate navigation layout with role-aware rendering.

### Phase 9: Admin Frontend Pages
- Create CRUD pages for Rooms, Faculty, Classes, and Students.
- Create the Timetable Builder with visual clash feedback.
- Integrate Campus Analytics dashboard utilizing Recharts.

### Phase 10: Teacher Frontend Pages
- Create Attendance Marking sheets, Assignments management console, Gradebook, and the Classroom Health & At-Risk dashboard.

### Phase 11: Student Frontend Pages
- Integrate My Timetable view, Assignment submission page, My Performance dashboard with Recharts trend lines, and Announcements board.

### Phase 12: End-to-End Verification
- Run complete `test_flow.py` integration sequence.
- Execute browser walkthrough and capture dashboard snapshots.

### Phase 13: UI Polish & Readme
- Check states (loading / error / empty), verify responsive design, and write instructions in README.

